# Accessibility: F1 -> 3. ASSETS & TEXT -> Overlay Text Size 175%; the dialog log must
# word-wrap the monologue at the larger size and hotspot labels must scale.
#! threshold 04_hotspots_175 0.12   (hotspot markers pulse with wall-clock time)
wait video 60
1000 tap Escape
wait menu 60
1500 expect menu
+0 shot 01_main_menu
+0 hash main_menu
+0 click 60 553
wait room x/006 30
1500 shot 02_chapter_select
+0 click 114 566
+2000 tap Escape
wait room l/001 30
wait interactive 120
1000 key down Left Ctrl
+100 tap L
+100 key up Left Ctrl
+800 shotfull 01_log_100
+0 tap Escape
+500 tap F1
+600 tap Tab
+300 tap Tab
+300 tap Up
+200 tap Up
+400 shotfull 02_menu_text_row
+0 tap Return
+300 tap Return
+300 tap Return
+500 shotfull 03_menu_175
+0 tap Escape
+500 key down Left Ctrl
+100 tap L
+100 key up Left Ctrl
+800 shotfull 03_log_175
+0 tap Escape
+500 move 400 120
+400 key down Space
+700 shotfull 04_hotspots_175
+0 key up Space
+300 quit
